# Web Development Assignment — Business Card & Pricing Cards

## Overview
This repository contains a two-page website featuring an interactive Business Card and a responsive Pricing Plans page built with semantic HTML5 and CSS Flexbox.

## Project Structure
```text
├── business-card.html   # Personal business card page
├── pricing.html         # 3-card pricing plans page
├── styles.css           # Unified CSS stylesheet
└── README.md            # Project documentation and deployment details